<title>UK: IBCA appoints new director of insurance division.</title>
<headline>IBCA appoints new director of insurance division.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Monday it recruited Geoffrey Mayne as a director of IBCA Quest Ltd, the agency's insurance division.</p>
<p>IBCA said Mayne joined the company from Standard &amp; Poor's Insurance Ratings in London.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6176</p>
</text>
